<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #2F5233">HOW TO USE</p>
<h2 id="howto-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.3; color: #12324F">How to use</h2>
</div>
<ol style="margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(240px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px">
<li style="border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #2F5233; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5233">01</span>
<span>Dispense 3–4 pumps onto dry hands and gently apply to a dry face.</span>
</li>
<li style="border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #2F5233; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
