<span>Using your fingertips, massage in light rolling motions from the center of the face outward and from bottom to top.</span>
</li>
<li style="border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #2F5233; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F5233">03</span>
<span>Gently cleanse along the jawline and cheeks, then rinse thoroughly with water.</span>
</li>
</ol>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px">
